l":"https://iesdouyin.com/share/video/7672598306175315306","normalizedUrl":"https://iesdouyin.com/share/video/7672598306175315306","domain":"iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"抖音","url":"https://iesdouyin.com/share/video/7589894574621902451","normalizedUrl":"https://iesdouyin.com/share/video/7589894574621902451","domain":"iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"抖音","url":"https://iesdouyin.com/share/video/7654157362026089780","normalizedUrl":"https://iesdouyin.com/share/video/7654157362026089780","domain":"iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"抖音","url":"https://iesdouyin.com/share/video/7673771497470561579","normalizedUrl":"https://iesdouyin.com/share/video/7673771497470561579","domain":"iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"抖音电商","url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/course-series/cJZHjLnhaLyw/cJZHjLnhaLywlJZJUawr9Aqg?from=buyin_message_jxlm&from_school=1&should_full_screen=1&should_hide_bottom_nav=1","normalizedUrl":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/course-series/cJZHjLnhaLyw/cJZHjLnhaLywlJZJUawr9Aqg?from=buyin_message_jxlm&from_school=1&should_full_screen=1&should_hide_bottom_nav=1","domain":"school.jinritemai.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"}]},{"id":"CMCR-CMP-20260819-C2-Q0098","q":"CMCR-Q0098","question":"抖音素材库和千川素材库有什么区别？","day":1,"repeat":2,"valid":true,"answer":"# 抖音素材库 vs 千川素材库\n> **抖音素材库**：抖音创作者后台（抖音APP/创作服务平台），服务自然内容发布；**千川素材库**：巨量千川广告后台，专门服务电商广告投放，二者数据不自动互通。\n\n|对比维度|抖音素材库（创作者素材库）|千川素材库（千川‑资产‑素材管理）|\n|---|---|---|\n|**入口位置**|抖音APP、抖音创作服务平台|巨量千川PC后台/千川APP【资产‑素材管理】|\n|**核心用途**|发布自然短视频、剪视频；提供免费BGM、特效、模板，做日常内容创作|广告投放用，存放投流的视频、图片，用于搭建千川广告计划、随心推|\n|**素材来源**|本地上传、平台版权音乐/音效、模板；抖音主页发布的作品存于此|手动上传广告物料；星图推送、第三方工具推送过来的广告素材；**抖音主页视频不会自动同步到千川素材库**|\n|**数据统计**|看播放、点赞、评论等自然流量数据|看广告消耗、点击率、转化率、ROI等投放广告数据，支持素材诊断、批量管理、跨子账号共享素材资产|\n|**版权&审核**|自然内容审核规则，适合短视频日常发布|执行广告审核规则，广告合规要求更严格，涉及电商宣传词、功效、资质校验|\n|**互通关系**|抖音主页视频，千川投放时可以直接选用主页视频，但**不会自动存入千川素材库**；千川素材库的广告素材，不会自动出现在抖音素材库/主页作品里|\n\n### 简单实操总结\n1. 发抖音日常短视频 → 用**抖音素材库**；\n2. 做电商投千川广告计划，集中管理投放物料、看广告效果 → 用**千川素材库**；\n3. 想用主页已发视频投千川：投放计划里直接勾选主页视频即可，不需要重新上传，但该视频不会出现在千川素材库列表中；\n4. 如果要把剪辑好的物料专门用来跑广告，建议直接上传到千川素材库，方便批量管理和看投放数据。\n\n### 常见坑\n> 千川素材库看不到抖音主页视频；抖音素材库看不到千川上传的广告素材，二者存储相互隔离，需要手动推送/上传，不会自动同步。\n\n如果你需要，我可以补充：怎么把抖音素材传到千川素材库的操作步骤。","answerHash":"3e078e7b395939d8260aedf49b94c5267cc8ae12f5e2afe78dedadd3804e7fda","finishedAt":"2026-08-18","replacement":false,"brands":[],"sources":[{"title":"抖音电商","url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/course-series/cJZHjLnhaLyw/cJZHjLnhaLywlJZJUawr9Aqg?from=gt%E8%B7%AF%E7%94%B1%E5%99%A8%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E7%BF%BB%E5%A2%99%E4%B8%8A%E5%9B%BD%E5%A4%96%E7%BD%91%E7%AB%99-%E2%9C%85%E6%98%93%E8%B7%AF%E6%8E%A8%E8%8D%90%F0%9F%94%B4lu911.com%E2%9C%85-%E6%81%90%E9%BE%99%E5%8C%96%E7%9F%B3%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99-%E4%B9%90%E9%AB%98%E5%AE%98%E7%BD%91-%E5%93%81%E7%89%8C%E7%BD%91%E7%BB%9C%E8%90%A5%E9%94%80%E6%8E%A8%E5%B9%BF%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8-%E2%9C%94%EF%B8%8F%E2%9C%94%EF%B8%8F%E6%98%93%E8%B7%AF%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%F0%9F%94%B4lu911.com%E2%9C%94%EF%B8%8F%E2%9C%94%EF%B8%8F-%E5%8D%96%E5%AE%B6%E7%B2%BE%E7%81%B5%E6%8F%92%E4%BB%B6%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%BE%E7%A4%BA%E4%BA%86-tiktok%E5%9F%B9%E8%AE%AD%E6%95%99%E5%AD%A6%E5%8F%98%E7%8E%B0&from_school=1&should_full_screen=1&should_hide_bottom_nav=1","normalizedUrl":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/course-series/cJZHjLnhaLyw/cJZHjLnhaLywlJZJUawr9Aqg?from=gt%E8%B7%AF%E7%94%B1%E5%99%A8%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E7%BF%BB%E5%A2%99%E4%B8%8A%E5%9B%BD%E5%A4%96%E7%BD%91%E7%AB%99-%E2%9C%85%E6%98%93%E8%B7%AF%E6%8E%A8%E8%8D%90%F0%9F%94%B4lu911.com%E2%9C%85-%E6%81%90%E9%BE%99%E5%8C%96%E7%9F%B3%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99-%E4%B9%90%E9%AB%98%E5%AE%98%E7%BD%91-%E5%93%81%E7%89%8C%E7%BD%91%E7%BB%9C%E8%90%A5%E9%94%80%E6%8E%A8%E5%B9%BF%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8-%E2%9C%94%EF%B8%8F%E2%9C%94%EF%B8%8F%E6%98%93%E8%B7%AF%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%F0%9F%94%B4lu911.com%E2%9C%94%EF%B8%8F%E2%9C%94%EF%B8%8F-%E5%8D%96%E5%AE%B6%E7%B2%BE%E7%81%B5%E6%8F%92%E4%BB%B6%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%BE%E7%A4%BA%E4%BA%86-tiktok%E5%9F%B9%E8%AE%AD%E6%95%99%E5%AD%A6%E5%8F%98%E7%8E%B0&from_school=1&should_full_screen=1&should_hide_bottom_nav=1","domain":"school.jinritemai.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"获取千川素材库视频-素材管理-商业开放平台","url":"https://open.oceanengine.com/docs/1739309912219663","normalizedUrl":"https://open.oceanengine.com/docs/1739309912219663","domain":"open.oceanengine.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"做了三年千川投放差点被淘汰，我是如何用抖音素材工具翻盘的?","url":"https://resources.youcloud.com/youshu/blog/3336","normalizedUrl":"https://resources.youcloud.com/youshu/blog/3336","domain":"resources.youcloud.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"CSDN博客","url":"https://blog.csdn.net/ccnuacmhdu/article/details/160561000","normalizedUrl":"https://blog.csdn.net/ccnuacmhdu/article/details/160561000","domain":"blog.csdn.net","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"抖音电商","url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/course-series/cJZHjLnhaLyw/cJZHjLnhaLywlJZJUawr8L8r?from_school=1&should_full_screen=1&should_hide_bottom_nav=1","normalizedUrl":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/course-series/cJZHjLnhaLyw/cJZHjLnhaLywlJZJUawr8L8r?from_school=1&should_full_screen=1&should_hide_bottom_nav=1","domain":"school.jinritemai.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"全方位攻略:千川素材文案创作技巧与高效应用指南 - 幺林灵","url":"https://488100.com/127623.html","normalizedUrl":"https://488100.com/127623.html","domain":"488100.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"抖音电商","url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/web/course-series/cJZHjLnhaLyw/cJZHjLnhaLywlJZJUawr9Aqg?from_school=1&should_full_screen=1&should_hide_bottom_nav=1","normalizedUrl":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/web/course-series/cJZHjLnhaLyw/cJZHjLnhaLywlJZJUawr9Aqg?from_school=1&should_full_screen=1&should_hide_bottom_nav=1","domain":"school.jinritemai.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"获取千川素材库图片-素材管理-商业开放平台","url":"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1739304248623182","normalizedUrl":"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1739304248623182","domain":"open.oceanengine.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"巨量星图素材集市操作指南-星图营销服务平台","url":"https://xingtu.cn/help-center/demander/133122","normalizedUrl":"https://xingtu.cn/help-center/demander/133122","domain":"xingtu.cn","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"📃【超级编导--巨量千川/广告】分发使用帮助","url":"https://help.superdir.cn/docs/chao-ji-bian-dao-ju-liang-qian-chuan-guang-gao-su-cai-fen-fa-shi-yong-bang-zhu","normalizedUrl":"https://help.superdir.cn/docs/chao-ji-bian-dao-ju-liang-qian-chuan-guang-gao-su-cai-fen-fa-shi-yong-bang-zhu","domain":"help.superdir.cn","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"‎考古加·创意-千川素材& 抖音广告素材分析工具 App - App Store","url":"https://apps.apple.com/cn/app/%E8%80%83%E5%8F%A4%E5%8A%A0-%E5%88%9B%E6%84%8F-%E5%8D%83%E5%B7%9D%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90-%E6%8A%96%E9%9F%B3%E5%B9%BF%E5%91%8A%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7/id6743687007","normalizedUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/cn/app/%E8%80%83%E5%8F%A4%E5%8A%A0-%E5%88%9B%E6%84%8F-%E5%8D%83%E5%B7%9D%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90-%E6%8A%96%E9%9F%B3%E5%B9%BF%E5%91%8A%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7/id6743687007","domain":"apps.apple.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"权限点与接口关系-入门指南-商业开放平台","url":"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1699625068225550","normalizedUrl":"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1699625068225550","domain":"open.oceanengine.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"}]},{"id":"CMCR-CMP-20260819-C3-Q0098","q":"CMCR-Q0098","question":"抖音素材库和千川素材库有什么区别？","day":1,"repeat":3,"valid":true,"answer":"# 抖音素材库 vs 千川素材库\n>抖音素材库：抖音APP/创作者后台的**内容创作素材库**，服务短视频自然内容创作；千川素材库：巨量千川广告后台的**广告素材资产库**，专门服务付费广告投放。\n\n### 1.定位与入口\n- **抖音素材库（创作者素材库）**\n入口：抖音APP剪辑页、抖音创作服务平台。面向普通创作者、达人。主要提供**版权音乐、音效、特效、模板、可商用视频片段**，用来剪辑发布普通短视频、图文作品，用于自然流量（不投广告）。\n\n- **千川素材库（广告创意素材库）**\n入口：千川PC后台-工具-创意管理（视频库/图片库），面向商家、投放优化师。用来存放广告上传的视频、图片，专门用于千川广告计划投放（随心推、专业计划、全域推广）。\n\n### 2.素材来源与用途\n- **抖音素材库**\n①平台提供版权音乐、BGM、特效、剪辑模板；\n②你剪辑时调用这些资源，产出**自然发布的短视频**；\n③产出的视频发布到抖音主页，可以后续拿来投千川，但素材本身不归入千川素材库。\n\n- **千川素材库**\n①自己上传广告视频、图片；也可同步即创生成的广告物料；\n②**不提供平台版权BGM模板**，只做自有广告物料存储管理；\n③直接在千川后台选择库内素材搭建广告计划，做付费投放。\n\n### 3.数据能力\n- **抖音素材库**：没有广告投放数据，只看作品发布后的点赞、评论等自然内容数据。\n- **千川素材库**：完整广告投放数据，可看消耗、点击率CTR、转化率CVR、ROI、曝光；支持打标签、筛选低效素材、素材共享给同组织账户，做素材资产管理。\n\n### 4.权限&审核\n- **抖音素材库**：素材只做内容剪辑，执行普通短视频内容审核；发布后是公开作品。\n- **千川素材库**：库内素材要过**广告审核**，有广告合规规则；素材可以只用于广告投放，不一定发布到抖音主页。\n\n### 5.核心区别简表\n|对比项|抖音素材库|千川素材库|\n|---|---|---|\n|核心用途|剪辑自然短视频|管理广告投放物料|\n|平台资源|提供BGM、音效、模板|无平台剪辑资源，只存自有物料|\n|数据维度|自然内容互动数据|广告消耗、转化、ROI投放数据|\n|使用场景|发抖音作品|搭建千川广告计划|\n|审核规则|普通内容审核|广告合规审核|\n\n### 补充小提示\n抖音主页发布过的视频，**不会自动同步到千川素材库**；千川投放时可以直接引用主页视频，但该视频文件不会存入千川素材库；需要投放广告，建议把视频单独上传一遍到千川素材库管理。\n\n要不要我简单说下两者之间素材互相调用的实操步骤？","answerHash":"684e7bb473e928cced9185897b5074609e260d118d372c7740aa4819c2557b5c","finishedAt":"2026-08-18","replacement":false,"brands":[],"sources":[{"title":"抖音电商","url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/course-series/cJZHjLnhaLyw/cJZHjLnhaLywlJZJUawr9Aqg?from=gt%E8%B7%AF%E7%94%B1%E5%99%A8%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E7%BF%BB%E5%A2%99%E4%B8%8A%E5%9B%BD%E5%A4%96%E7%BD%91%E7%AB%99-%E2%9C%85%E6%98%93%E8%B7%AF%E6%8E%A8%E8%8D%90%F0%9F%94%B4lu911.com%E2%9C%85-%E6%81%90%E9%BE%99%E5%8C%96%E7%9F%B3%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99-%E4%B9%90%E9%AB%98%E5%AE%98%E7%BD%91-%E5%93%81%E7%89%8C%E7%BD%91%E7%BB%9C%E8%90%A5%E9%94%80%E6%8E%A8%E5%B9%BF%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8-%E2%9C%94%EF%B8%8F%E2%9C%94%EF%B8%8F%E6%98%93%E8%B7%AF%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%F0%9F%94%B4lu911.com%E2%9C%94%EF%B8%8F%E2%9C%94%EF%B8%8F-%E5%8D%96%E5%AE%B6%E7%B2%BE%E7%81%B5%E6%8F%92%E4%BB%B6%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%BE%E7%A4%BA%E4%BA%86-tiktok%E5%9F%B9%E8%AE%AD%E6%95%99%E5%AD%A6%E5%8F%98%E7%8E%B0&from_school=1&should_full_screen=1&should_hide_bottom_nav=1","normalizedUrl":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/course-series/cJZHjLnhaLyw/